############ 3 · E3〔D2 的核心〕LC_ALL 指向不存在的 locale：有没有任何一声
  setlocale 本身怎么说（同一条 glibc 路径）：
    LC_ALL=C.UTF-8 -> rc=0  charmap=UTF-8
    LC_ALL=zz_ZZ.UTF-8 -> rc=0  charmap=locale: Cannot set LC_CTYPE to default locale: No such file or directory|locale: Cannot set LC_MESSAGES to default locale: No such file or directory|locale: Cannot set LC_ALL to default locale: No such file or directory|ANSI_X3.4-1968
    LC_ALL=xx_XX -> rc=0  charmap=locale: Cannot set LC_CTYPE to default locale: No such file or directory|locale: Cannot set LC_MESSAGES to default locale: No such file or directory|locale: Cannot set LC_ALL to default locale: No such file or directory|ANSI_X3.4-1968
  tmux 在 BOGUS 下的 stderr（上面 E2 已把 2>&1 并进来了，这里单独看 stderr）：
    退出码 = 0   stderr 字节数 = 0   内容 = []

